{"4433630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "KritterRun", "steam_appid": 4433630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Race. Learn. Win.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KritterRun is a multiplayer racing game that teaches Japanese through speed, not memorization. Hit binary gates at full speed—left for correct, right for wrong—while racing against friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master 500+ vocabulary words and 100 kanji by playing, not grinding flashcards. No punishment for mistakes. Just fast laps, unlockable cosmetics, and leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FallGuys meets Duolingo—except it's actually fun.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Race. Learn. Win.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KritterRun is a multiplayer racing game that teaches Japanese through speed, not memorization. Hit binary gates at full speed—left for correct, right for wrong—while racing against friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master 500+ vocabulary words and 100 kanji by playing, not grinding flashcards. No punishment for mistakes. Just fast laps, unlockable cosmetics, and leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FallGuys meets Duolingo—except it's actually fun.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Race and learn Japanese! KritterRun is a multiplayer racing game where you master vocabulary through fast-paced binary gates—left for correct, right for wrong. Fall Guys meets language learning. No flashcards, no punishment, just fun.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4433630/4bc5636806b66d3f1c645698ac1b89e32908ac04/header.jpg?t=1773330581", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4433630/e3d78e93abc5c0de4a259f1b14b2bef7578ee